// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
; specs/course/verify-hardware.t27 -- the verification course: testbenches, waveforms, formal, mutation
; Source of truth for apps/website/scripts/course-from-spec.mjs (gHashTag/trinity), which
; compiles this file with the vendored compiler (public/t27/t27_compiler.wasm), checks the
; constant schema, evaluates every test block below, checks that every widget a lesson names
; is in specs/widgets/gallery.t27 and that every gallery widget is used by some lesson of some
; course, compiles every lesson spec and refuses one that is not clean, checks the Russian
; bundle named by specs/course/verify-hardware-ru.t27, and only then writes its share of
; src/lib/course.generated.ts and a byte-identical copy of this file at
; public/learn/verify-hardware.t27.
; ASCII only (L3), English only (LANG-EN). The Russian words live in the bundle.

; WHAT THE COURSE IS: course 3 of specs/course/courses.t27, 27 lessons in 9 modules of 3, for a
; reader who has a design that compiles and wants to trust it: testbenches that check
; themselves, waveforms read like a hardware engineer reads them, conformance vectors,
; cosimulation against the board, coverage and what it hides, assertions and bounded model
; checking, mutation testing, and a sign-off you can show. Each lesson is a short text, one
; working widget from the gallery, one t27 spec the reader runs in the player, and one thing to
; try in both. The widgets are not drawn for the course: they are the same verification tools a
; hardware engineer uses on t27.ai, built from real runs of t27c, tri, yosys, nextpnr and
; openFPGALoader on our bench, whose chip is an Artix-7 XC7A200T.

; WHAT THE COURSE DOES NOT DO: it says no number of its own. A number a lesson needs is on the
; widget or in the spec, which names the run that produced it. A testbench's tests do not run
; in the browser player yet (gHashTag/trinity#1477); lessons show the recorded output of real
; runs instead, and say so where it matters.

; WHY 27: 3 cubed lessons, the size of a TRI-27 word. Changing the shape changes the tests.
; phi^2 + 1/phi^2 = 3 | TRINITY

